    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is an application software for 3D desktop pets.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It supports importing\u00a0 most 3D format models, such as (VRM/FBX/OBJ/glTF2, etc.).</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Currently, users can only upload VRM files to support various basic actions, motion capture and cloning movements from uploaded videos.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It supports desktop special effects, such as the effects of rain, fireworks, mouse trails and so on.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Disclaimer: Some of the models demonstrated can be downloaded from the Creative Workshop. The application does not come with the models demonstrated directly.</p></li></ul>",
